++//!
++//! Compile and reflection call [`apply_supported`] after the function's own ABI check. A supported
++//! binding's execution source is the checked base plus the script values; reflection, properties,
++//! and the constant dictionary answer that source, not the function's own tags. The function's own
++//! hash, bytes, and public name are not replaced.
