++//! Only version 0.1.0, generator `NativeTranslator`, absent `specialized_name`, and i32/bool
++//! values are applied. Every other established or unreadable form stays
++//! [`Feature::MetallibSpecialization`]. Caller values are not consulted here and must not be
++//! merged over the script.
